  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c7/Guinea_Pig_House.png/revision/latest?cb=20210814222638\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Guinea Pig house\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Guinea Pig house\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Guinea Pig house</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animal-shelters-33414\" title=\"Animal Shelters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal Shelter</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 60</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 25,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Houses </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><br><span><a href=\"/wiki/teddy-guinea-pig-35043\" title=\"Teddy Guinea Pig\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Teddy Guinea Pig\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/44/Teddy_Guinea_Pig.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20240403071942\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><span><a href=\"/wiki/sheba-guinea-pig-35211\" title=\"Sheba Guinea Pig\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sheba Guinea Pig\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><span><a href=\"/wiki/silkie-guinea-pig-35277\" title=\"Silkie Guinea Pig\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Silkie Guinea Pig\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span> (x2)</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Guinea pig houses</b> are shelters for <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-guinea-pigs-35046\" title=\"Category:Guinea Pigs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">guinea pigs</a>. They are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 60.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p>The house is a wooden guinea pig house, with a ramp and two blue tunnels.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Building</b></span></h3>\n<p>Each house costs 25,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> and can hold up to three guinea pigs. Building them takes no time.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-animal-shelters-6565\" title=\"Category:Animal Shelters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal Shelters</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/alpaca-house-36823\" title=\"Alpaca House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Alpaca House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/beehive-tree-15804\" title=\"Beehive Tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Beehive Tree Stage 4\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/bird-house-35210\" title=\"Bird House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bird House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"142\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/bunny-house-12523\" title=\"Bunny House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bunny House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/cat-house-2711\" title=\"Cat House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cat House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/chicken-coop-2715\" title=\"Chicken Coop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chicken Coop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/cow-pasture-2717\" title=\"Cow Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cow Pasture\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/dog-house-2713\" title=\"Dog House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Dog House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/donkey-stable-9426\" title=\"Donkey Stable\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Donkey Stable\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/goat-yard-2723\" title=\"Goat Yard\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Goat Yard\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/guinea-pig-house-35051\" title=\"Guinea Pig House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Guinea Pig House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/horse-stable-2709\" title=\"Horse Stable\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Horse Stable\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/kitten-house-18341\" title=\"Kitten House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Kitten House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/lamb-pasture-36754\" title=\"Lamb Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lamb Pasture\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"58\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/pig-pen-2719\" title=\"Pig Pen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pig Pen\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/puppy-house-18339\" title=\"Puppy House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Puppy House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/sheep-pasture-2721\" title=\"Sheep Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sheep Pasture\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/squirrel-house-33971\" title=\"Squirrel House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Squirrel House Stage 4\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"140\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/buildings-3577\" title=\"Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Buildings</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831161213\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.113 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.139 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 572/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6838/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1716/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 650174/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   87.730      1 -total\n 69.09%   60.616      1 Template:Infobox\n 27.69%   24.290      3 Template:Infoicon\n 16.43%   14.417      1 Template:Navigation\n  9.02%    7.915      1 Template:AnimalSheltersMenu\n  7.93%    6.954      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  6.44%    5.654      1 Template:NavMenu\n 